<title>UK: London gold fixes touch firmer, PGMs mark time..</title>
<headline>London gold fixes touch firmer, PGMs mark time..</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed just firmer $344.25 vs $343.85 AM. Slightly ahead with New York despite easing PGMs. Resistance forecast at $345.00 and over. Little momentum behind price.</p>
<p>SILVER - $4.82/$4.84 quiet, speculative. Down seven cents.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Easier at $466.00/$471.00. Quiet, nervous.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - About $5.00 firmer at $224.00/$234.00. Nervous and awaiting news of Russian shipments.</p>
</text>
